# Optional: enables AI photo analysis. Without it, the app works fully
# except the AI panel, which shows a graceful "analysis disabled" note.
# On Vercel, set this in Project Settings > Environment Variables.
# WARNING: a VITE_ variable is embedded in the client bundle and visible
# to anyone using the app - use a low-limit key you can rotate.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
